{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里仍没底，开始重新想眼前还能承担什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"还能承担什么\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他已经试过，行动带来的力气并不能消掉对那种生活的牵挂。\",\n      \"key\": \"行动带来的力气\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他又想怪自己不够坚定，可再逼自己一把也没用，他舍不得停下争取，也舍不得那种生活给他的安慰。\",\n      \"key\": \"再逼自己一把\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"text\": \"想到要付出的代价，他心里还是疼，盼着别失去太多。\",\n      \"key\": \"盼着别失去太多\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他还没想出两边都顾到的办法，也怕失去安宁，却不再要求自己先不害怕才肯动，还是先做眼前该争取的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"眼前该争取\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R50\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留非此即彼的逼迫松动后重新考虑能做什么的起点，并接回上一段的变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"行动带来力量已在前段写过，压短重复部分，保留行动不能消掉对那种生活的牵挂这一限度。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R52\", \"R53\", \"R54\", \"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"明确他难处不只是意志不够，而是舍不得停下争取，也舍不得那种生活给他的安慰。删去重复怀念不能保护珍惜之物的结论，改由S07-2的箭头接回愿望尚未实现、眼前仍有威胁的经历。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R56\", \"R57\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-4\", \"S11-5\", \"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"停下争取的顾虑由S07-2的箭头说明，心疼与不愿失去太多留在S11-5，删除与S11-6重复的行动结论，不再用等待无用的格言解释他为什么向前。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他仍怕失去安宁、还没找到兼顾办法，却不再要求自己先不害怕才行动的变化；删去重复的原则句，把选择落到眼前该争取的事上。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ec5cb90d-0866-469f-947a-695b7ad89a97", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T202756533977Z", "elapsed_seconds": 554.75, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T20:37:11.288764+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "99d2ac03e449a335dbdc085bb686ffc0499fc9a9132220121a8b8f2b037682b2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatg